<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text font-size="16px" color="#333333" line-height="24px" />
      <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="20px" />
      <mj-button
        background-color="#68246D"
        color="#ffffff"
        font-weight="bold"
        border-radius="4px"
      />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      .header-text {
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .exec-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-top: 10px;
      }
      .exec-table td {
        padding: 8px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .role-name {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #68246D;
        width: 40%;
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#f4f4f4">
    <mj-section background-color="#68246D" padding="40px 20px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          width="300px"
          src="https://harryrich02.github.io/DUMC/img/dumcCrest.png"
          alt="DUMC Crest"
        />
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          color="#ffffff"
          font-size="28px"
          font-weight="900"
          css-class="header-text"
        >
          WAD WEEKLY
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-top="30px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          Hope everyone's been getting settled in to the club and looking forward to the upcoming meets! A quieter one this week, so lets dive straight in.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-bottom="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="22px" font-weight="bold" color="#68246D"
          >📅 COMING UP</mj-text
        >
        <mj-divider border-width="2px" border-color="#68246D" />
        <mj-text>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Thu 8:00pm:</strong> Team Training (DCC)</li>
            <li>
              <strong>Mon 7:30pm:</strong> Beer & Boulder (DCC + The Water
              House)
            </li>
          </ul>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#fafafa">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="22px" font-weight="bold" color="#68246D"
          >🧗 LAST WEEK IN THE DUMC</mj-text
        >
        <mj-divider border-width="2px" border-color="#68246D" />

        <mj-text font-size="18px" font-weight="bold"
          >Team Trials</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text>
          Big thank you to everyone for attending team trials and the mini comp sim we ran. Good to see so many people looking forward to competitions this year.</br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The main competition team has been selected so congratulations to all those I chose, and unlucky to all those who didn’t quite make it (there were a lot of very good climbers).</br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;I will be adding people to a devs and comp team group chat over the coming weeks so keep an eye out for that!!!</br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The leaderboard from the sim will be announced within the next week (if not the next wad weekly).</br>
          <strong>- Your capitan</strong>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text font-size="18px" font-weight="bold"
          >Intro to Trad Course</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text>
          In beautiful conditions a few kittens took to the Lakes for an Intro to Trad Course. Knots were tied, climbers were belayed, and gear was placed. If you fancy giving this a try look out for more courses coming out throughout the year!
        </mj-text>
        <mj-image src="https://harryrich02.github.io/DUMC/img/alice-tradCourse.jpg" width="225px" height="300px" alt="Kittens on a Trad Course" />
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-top="40px">
      <mj-column border="2px dashed #68246D" border-radius="10px">
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          font-size="20px"
          font-weight="bold"
          color="#68246D"
          >💪 WAD OF THE WEEK</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text align="center" font-style="italic">
          Alasdair and Ethan G for driving my lovely trad course this weekend!</br>
          <strong>- Lola</strong>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-top="20px" padding-bottom="40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          <strong>Harry Richards</strong><br />
          DUMC President
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#222222" padding="40px 20px">
      <mj-column vertical-align="middle">
        <mj-image
          width="120px"
          src="https://harryrich02.github.io/DUMC/img/dumcLogo.png"
          alt="DUMC Logo"
        />
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column vertical-align="middle">
        <mj-text
          color="#ffffff"
          font-size="14px"
          align="center"
          padding-bottom="10px"
        >
          <strong>Durham University Mountaineering Club</strong>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-social font-size="15px" icon-size="30px" mode="horizontal">
          <mj-social-element
            name="instagram"
            href="https://www.instagram.com/du.mountaineering"
            background-color="#68246D"
          ></mj-social-element>
          <mj-social-element
            name="facebook"
            href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/DUMC.Forum"
            background-color="#68246D"
          ></mj-social-element>
        </mj-social>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="13px" padding-top="15px">
          <a
            href="https://mountaineeringclub.webspace.durham.ac.uk/"
            style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline"
            >Visit our Website</a
          >
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
